1. The flags Cargo passes to rustc for hello_macro
--crate-type proc-macro
--extern proc_macro

2. rustc --edition 2024 --crate-type proc-macro lib.rs
error[E0432]: unresolved import `proc_macro`
 --> lib.rs:5:5
  |
5 | use proc_macro::{TokenStream, TokenTree};
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^ use of unresolved module or unlinked crate `proc_macro`
  |
  = help: you might be missing a crate named `proc_macro`

error: aborting due to 1 previous error

For more information about this error, try `rustc --explain E0432`.
exit status 1

3. rustc --edition 2024 --crate-type proc-macro --extern proc_macro lib.rs
exit status 0

4. the same file with extern crate proc_macro; added, and no --extern
exit status 0
libhello_macro.dylib on macOS, libhello_macro.so on Linux
